Secure Text Editor – User Guide & Features
Version 3.0
________________________________________
Overview
Secure Text Editor is a lightweight, offline, privacy-first text editor that stores your documents in encrypted form on disk. Unlike cloud-based editors or standard notepad applications, it protects your content even if someone knows the file path — encrypted documents cannot be read without your master password.
This version introduces file-level AES encryption (.stxt format), giving you a true security boundary between plain text and protected content.
