Key Features
File-Level Encryption (New)
•	.stxt Format – Encrypted documents use a custom .stxt extension.
•	AES-128-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 (Fernet) with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 key derivation, 100,000 iterations, 16-byte random salt per file.
•	Per-File Salt – Even identical content produces different ciphertext across files.
•	Auto-Detection – The editor reads the file header and knows whether to prompt for a password.
•	Plain .txt Compatibility – You can still open and save standard plain text files; you choose the format when saving a new file.
•	Save As Menu – Explicitly save the current buffer as .stxt or .txt at any time.
Privacy & Security
•	100% Offline – No cloud sync, no telemetry, no internet connection required.
•	Encrypted History – Recent file paths and timestamps are AES-encrypted before being written to disk.
•	Encrypted License File – Registration details stored with AES encryption.
•	Encrypted Lock Password – Stored as a PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 hash (100k iterations, 16-byte salt), then AES-encrypted on disk.
•	Encrypted Master Password Verification – A verify token is stored encrypted; the master password is never written to disk in plain form.
•	Secure Delete – Document content is overwritten in memory before release.
•	Audit Log – All significant events are logged locally (open, save, lock, unlock, backup, replace, master password changes).
Lock & Unlock
•	Persistent Lock Password – Set once, reuse forever. No repeated setup.
•	One-Key Lock – Press Ctrl+L or click Lock → locks instantly.
•	Full-Screen Overlay – Dark overlay completely hides document content.
•	Auto-Lock on Idle – Locks automatically after a configurable period of inactivity.
•	Change / Clear Password – Manage anytime from the Protection menu.
•	Read-Only Mode – Ctrl+R for view-only access.
Editor
•	Multi-Document Interface – Left sidebar lists all open documents with modified indicators (*).
•	Recent Files with Timestamps – Last 10 files with their last-access time, persisted across sessions.
•	Find & Replace – Highlight search, find next/previous, replace one or all.
•	Word Wrap Toggle – Auto-wrap long lines or horizontal scroll.
•	Full Undo/Redo – Multi-level undo history.
•	Right-Click Context Menu – Cut, copy, paste, find, replace, backup, and Save As.
•	UTF-8 / GBK Encoding Support – Reads legacy encodings automatically.
Backup System
•	Auto-Backup – Silent backup every 60 seconds (configurable).
•	Manual Backup – One-click from sidebar or menu.
•	Version History – Keeps the last 10 backups per file; older versions auto-cleaned.
•	Restore Any Version – One click from the backup viewer.
•	Backup Runs While Locked – Data protection never stops.
•	Encrypted Files – Encrypted (.stxt) content is not backed up to prevent plaintext leakage; only the ciphertext on disk is authoritative.
Data Management
•	Custom Data Directory – Choose where config, history, and backups are stored; migrate existing data with one click.
•	Clear Sensitive Data – Wipes history, clipboard, undo buffer, and forces garbage collection.
•	File Size Limits – Prevent memory exhaustion (50 MB default, up to 2× for encrypted files due to base64 overhead).
•	Document Limit – Cap on simultaneous open documents (default 100).
Licensing
•	One-Machine-One-Code – Each license is bound to a unique hardware fingerprint.
•	Machine Code Auto-Generation – Copy and send; no manual entry required.
•	Encrypted Local Storage – License data AES-encrypted on disk.
•	Auto-Revalidation – Verified on each startup; invalid licenses are removed automatically.
