Getting Started
Registration (First Launch)
1.	Launch the application. A registration window appears automatically.
2.	Your machine code is generated and displayed. Click Copy.
3.	Send your email address and machine code to the software author.
4.	You will receive a 16-character license code.
5.	Enter your email and license code → click Register.
6.	Verification succeeds → the main editor opens. No further registration on this machine.
Set Master Encryption Password (Required for .stxt)
1.	Menu: 🛡️ Protection → Set Master Encryption Password
2.	If a master password already exists, enter the current one.
3.	Enter and confirm the new master password (minimum 4 characters).
4.	The verify token is stored encrypted; the password is cached in memory for this session.
⚠️ Warning: If you forget the master password, encrypted files cannot be recovered. Back up the password in a secure location.
First Lock Password Setup
1.	Press Ctrl+L (or click 🔒 Lock) for the first time.
2.	Dialog appears: Set Lock Password.
3.	Enter and confirm a password (minimum 3 characters).
4.	When asked "Save this password permanently?":
o	Yes → stored encrypted; future locks require no setup.
o	No → valid only for this session.
5.	The editor locks immediately with a full-screen overlay.
Subsequent Locks
•	Press Ctrl+L → editor locks instantly. No prompts.
Unlocking
•	Enter your saved password in the overlay → press Enter or click Unlock.
•	Incorrect attempts show an inline error.
